<title>UK: STB Cayman sets 100 bln yen exchangeable bond.</title>
<headline>STB Cayman sets 100 bln yen exchangeable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Salomon Brothers International Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STB CAYMAN CAPITAL LTD</p>
<p> AMT    100 BLN YEN   COUPON   **0.5-1.0   MATURITY    01.OCT.07</p>
<p> TYPE   EXCHANGEABLE  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    =</p>
<p> NOTES    **INDICATED. EXCHANGEABLE FOR COMMON STOCK OF THE</p>
<p>		SUMITOMO TRUST AND BANKING CO LTD</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (M) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	GUARANTEED ON A SUBORDINATED BASIS BY SUMITOMO TRUST</p>
<p>		AND BANKING CO.</p>
</text>
